cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Marketplace Learning to Rank in research or teaching, please cite this software."
title: "Marketplace Learning to Rank"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Rana
    given-names: Jahanzaib
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-7085-0440"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ranajahanzaib/marketplace-learning-to-rank"
license: MIT
abstract: "Marketplace Learning to Rank is a local learning-to-rank lab for professional service marketplaces. It applies marketplace eligibility rules before retrieval, combines lexical and local dense retrieval, and compares a transparent rules baseline, a semantic baseline, and LightGBM LambdaMART over a shared candidate pool."
keywords:
  - learning-to-rank
  - lambdamart
  - information-retrieval
  - marketplace
  - search
